WEBVTT

00:18:58.954 --> 00:19:01.204
We were very surprised. We were amazed.

00:19:01.496 --> 00:19:04.746
Like I say, we knew that they
came by not that much.

00:19:05.038 --> 00:19:09.829
And we continue paying all our bills. And
I'm telling us today it it's amazing.

00:19:09.871 --> 00:19:11.163
It's amazing. Amazing.

00:19:12.121 --> 00:19:14.996
I found in my research that cultures
of giving don't just start from

00:19:14.996 --> 00:19:17.746
the top down. They often grow
from the bottom up.

00:19:18.371 --> 00:19:21.996
Morgan Stanley employees ended up raising
enough money to support Edith

00:19:21.996 --> 00:19:25.371
and Angela over the past year,
but it didn't end there.

00:19:25.829 --> 00:19:28.996
They've now provided financial support
to thousands of food vendors in

00:19:28.996 --> 00:19:30.704
New York City during the pandemic.